{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, fully responsive Shopify Liquid section for Kiss & Kry titled "Outgrown, Not Outworn."
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: Use the uploaded reference image as the primary design reference. Recreate the exact visual structure, proportions, layout, typography, spacing, image placement, colours and styling. Do not redesign or introduce alternative layouts.
    
    The section should look like a luxury editorial landing page for a premium bamboo babywear brand.
    
    1. Overall Section Design
    
    Create one full-width section with two distinct horizontal areas:
    
    Upper area: Main Giving Back introduction and product imagery.
    
    Lower area: Four-step horizontal process timeline.
    
    Main background:
    
    Deep muted olive green: #5D6748.
    
    Primary text: #F6F2E7.
    
    Secondary text: #C4C6AD.
    
    Accent gold: #EBAE29.
    
    Icon outlines: #D5C99B.
    
    Subtle borders: rgba(235, 231, 205, 0.25).
    
    Use Montserrat throughout.
    
    Add subtle oversized circular outline decorations in the background. These should be extremely subtle and must not interfere with the content.
    
    2. Upper Section – Two-Column Layout
    
    Desktop layout:
    
    Left column: Approximately 46% width.
    
    Right column: Approximately 54% width.
    
    Overall content width: 92%.
    
    Center content within the section.
    
    Generous spacing between columns.
    
    3. Left Column – Giving Back Introduction
    
    At the top, create a small eyebrow label:
    
    "GIVING BACK"
    
    Place a short horizontal golden line before the label.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Outgrown,
    Not Outworn."
    
    Typography:
    
    Montserrat Bold.
    
    38–42px desktop.
    
    Ivory colour.
    
    Tight line height.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Two-line composition exactly as shown.
    
    Description:
    
    "Send back outgrown Kiss & Kry pieces. We pass them on to families in need — and thank you with 15% off."
    
    Style:
    
    13px desktop.
    
    Muted sage-beige colour.
    
    Approximately 1.7 line height.
    
    Highlight "15% off" in golden yellow.
    
    4. Three Small Benefit Pills
    
    Directly below the description, create three horizontally aligned outlined pill badges.
    
    Each pill must have a tiny gold/olive icon and small text.
    
    Pill 1:
    
    Leaf icon.
    
    "Less waste"
    
    Pill 2:
    
    Community/users icon.
    
    "Stronger community"
    
    Pill 3:
    
    Heart icon.
    
    "Shared purpose"
    
    Styling:
    
    Transparent olive background.
    
    Thin subtle beige border.
    
    Rounded pill corners.
    
    10–11px text.
    
    Small gold icons.
    
    Consistent spacing.
    
    5. Primary CTA Button
    
    Below the three pills, create one primary button:
    
    "Start a return →"
    
    Styling:
    
    Warm ivory background (#F6F2E7).
    
    Olive-green text (#5D6748).
    
    Rounded pill shape.
    
    Approximately 112px wide and 36px high.
    
    Montserrat medium.
    
    Smooth hover transition.
    
    Make its URL editable in Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    6. Right Column – Product Image Composition
    
    This is a critical visual element. Reproduce the overlapping image arrangement from the reference.
    
    Use two product/lifestyle photographs.
    
    Image 1 – Return Package
    
    Large vertical rectangular photograph.
    
    Show a premium kraft cardboard return box.
    
    Kiss & Kry logo printed in the centre.
    
    Warm beige neutral background.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Approximate dimensions: 170px × 220px.
    
    Image 2 – Happy Baby
    
    Smaller landscape/portrait rectangular photograph.
    
    Show a happy smiling baby sitting in a cream Kiss & Kry outfit.
    
    Warm neutral nursery setting.
    
    Brand logo visible on the garment.
    
    Rounded corners.
    
    Approximate dimensions: 135px × 170px.
    
    Position:
    
    Return package image on the left.
    
    Baby image on the right.
    
    Slight overlap or close spacing, matching the reference.
    
    Align both images vertically around the centre of the right column.
    
    Use Shopify image picker settings for both photographs.
    
    7. Prominent 15% Reward Badge
    
    Create a large circular golden-yellow reward badge overlapping the lower-right portion of the return package image.
    
    Text:
    
    "15%"
    
    Below:
    
    "OFF YOUR
    NEXT ORDER"
    
    Styling:
    
    Circular shape.
    
    Golden yellow background: #EBAE29.
    
    Thin olive border.
    
    Diameter approximately 82–90px.
    
    Dark olive typography.
    
    25px bold percentage.
    
    7–8px uppercase supporting text.
    
    Soft, subtle shadow.
    
    Position the circle at the intersection of the two images, slightly overlapping the lower edge.
    
    This badge is a key visual element and must be clearly visible.
    
    , 8. Lower Section – How It Works Timeline
    
    Create a full-width horizontal process timeline beneath the upper section.
    
    Add a small uppercase label:
    
    "HOW IT WORKS"
    
    Place a thin horizontal line extending across the section underneath the label.
    
    Create four equally spaced process steps in a single row.
    
    Connect all four steps using a thin dotted horizontal line passing through the icon centres.
    
    STEP 01 – RETURN
    
    Icon: Package / parcel.
    
    Heading:
    "Return"
    
    Description:
    "Send back outgrown pieces."
    
    STEP 02 – REWARD
    
    Icon: Percentage symbol.
    
    Heading:
    "Reward"
    
    Description:
    "Get 15% off your next order."
    
    Highlight "15% off" in golden yellow.
    
    Make this icon circle visually prominent with a solid golden background and olive percentage symbol.
    
    STEP 03 – REDISTRIBUTE
    
    Icon: Home.
    
    Heading:
    "Redistribute"
    
    Description:
    "We clean and pass them on."
    
    STEP 04 – REJOICE
    
    Icon: Smile / happy face.
    
    Heading:
    "Rejoice"
    
    Description:
    "Another family smiles."
    
    9. Timeline Styling
    
    Each step should contain:
    
    Circular icon holder: approximately 34px.
    
    Icon colour: golden yellow or olive.
    
    Icon background: transparent with subtle outline.
    
    Heading: 15px Montserrat semibold, ivory.
    
    Description: 11px muted sage-beige.
    
    All four steps must have equal width and consistent alignment.
    
    Use Lucide outline icons:
    
    package
    
    percent
    
    house
    
    smile
    
    Keep the second step highlighted with a golden circle.
    
    10. Responsive Design
    
    Desktop:
    
    Two-column upper section.
    
    Overlapping image composition.
    
    Horizontal four-step timeline.
    
    Preserve all original proportions.
    
    Tablet:
    
    Reduce image sizes and column spacing.
    
    Maintain visual balance.
    
    Keep timeline horizontal where space allows.
    
    Mobile:
    
    Stack the introduction and image composition vertically.
    
    Maintain the overlapping 15% reward badge.
    
    Convert the four-step process into a compact two-column grid or vertically stacked timeline.
    
    Avoid text clipping and horizontal overflow.
    
    Keep all elements readable.
    
    11. Shopify Theme Editor Customization
    
    Make all important content editable.
    
    Include settings for:
    
    General
    
    Background colour.
    
    Heading colour.
    
    Body text colour.
    
    Accent colour.
    
    Section padding.
    
    Maximum content width.
    
    Introduction
    
    Eyebrow text.
    
    Main heading.
    
    Description.
    
    Highlighted discount text.
    
    Benefit Pills
    
    Icon selection.
    
    Text.
    
    Add/remove/reorder blocks.
    
    Images
    
    Return box image picker.
    
    Baby lifestyle image picker.
    
    Image dimensions and corner radius.
    
    Reward Badge
    
    Percentage value.
    
    Supporting text.
    
    Badge background colour.
    
    Badge size.
    
    CTA
    
    Button label.
    
    Button URL.
    
    Button background and text colours.
    
    Timeline
    
    Eyebrow heading.
    
    Four editable process blocks.
    
    Icon selection.
    
    Step title.
    
    Description.
    
    Icon background and accent colour., enhance this section fix all the wrong aligements and styling
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% capture highlighted_description %}{{ block.settings.description | escape | replace: block.settings.discount_text, '<mark>' | replace: '<mark>', '<strong>' | replace: block.settings.discount_text, '</strong>' }}{% endcapture %}
{% style %}
.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:{{ block.settings.bg_color }};color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }},.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }} *{box-sizing:border-box}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}:before,.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:360px;height:360px;border:1px solid rgba(235,231,205,.07);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;top:-260px;right:-120px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}:after{width:440px;height:440px;top:auto;right:auto;bottom:-320px;left:-260px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{position:relative;z-index:1;width:min(92%,{{ block.settings.content_max_width }}px);margin:0 auto;padding:{{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 0}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.92fr) minmax(0,1.08fr);align-items:center;column-gap:clamp(28px,5vw,72px)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow,.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timeline-label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:0 0 16px;color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow:before{content:'';width:25px;height:1px;background:currentColor}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{margin:0;white-space:normal;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-size:clamp(36px,3.3vw,42px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.04em}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title span{display:block}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description{max-width:390px;margin:18px 0;color:{{ block.settings.body_color }};font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description strong,.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step-desc strong{color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin:0 0 22px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:27px;padding:5px 9px;border:1px solid rgba(235,231,205,.28);border-radius:999px;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-size:10px;line-height:1.2}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill svg{width:13px;height:13px;flex:none;stroke:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};fill:none;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta{display:inline-flex;min-width:142px;min-height:38px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 16px;border-radius:999px;background:{{ block.settings.button_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.button_text }};font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:filter .2s ease}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta:hover{filter:brightness(.92)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid {{ block.settings.accent_color }};outline-offset:3px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual{position:relative;min-height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px 4px 28px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo{position:relative;flex:none;overflow:hidden;border-radius:{{ block.settings.image_radius }}px;background:#e8e0d1;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(25,30,18,.16)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--box{width:min({{ block.settings.return_image_width }}px,44%);height:{{ block.settings.return_image_height }}px;z-index:1;margin-right:-8px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--baby{width:min({{ block.settings.baby_image_width }}px,36%);height:{{ block.settings.baby_image_height }}px;z-index:2;margin-top:34px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder,.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;background:#e8e0d1}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:5px;right:5px;color:#343b28;font-size:9px;text-align:center}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:50%;bottom:12px;display:flex;width:{{ block.settings.badge_size }}px;height:{{ block.settings.badge_size }}px;transform:translateX(-50%);flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid {{ block.settings.bg_color }};border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.badge_bg }};color:#303723;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(20,25,15,.2)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__percent{font-size:25px;font-weight:700;line-height:1}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward-caption{max-width:66px;margin-top:4px;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timeline{margin-top:35px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(235,231,205,.25)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timeline-label{margin:0 0 20px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));align-items:start}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track:before{position:absolute;content:'';top:17px;left:12.5%;right:12.5%;border-top:1px dotted rgba(213,201,155,.7)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step{position:relative;z-index:1;min-width:0;padding:0 10px;text-align:center}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{display:flex;width:35px;height:35px;margin:0 auto 10px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:1px solid rgba(213,201,155,.75);border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.icon_bg }};color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};box-sizing:border-box}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg{width:17px;height:17px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step--featured .ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};border-color:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:{{ block.settings.bg_color }}}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step-title{margin:0 0 5px;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step-desc{max-width:190px;margin:0 auto;color:{{ block.settings.body_color }};font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}
@media(max-width:749px){.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}{width:100%}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner{width:88%;padding:42px 0 34px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);row-gap:18px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font-size:clamp(35px,9vw,42px)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual{min-height:255px;padding:4px 0 24px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--box{height:min({{ block.settings.return_image_height }}px,215px)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--baby{height:min({{ block.settings.baby_image_height }}px,165px);margin-top:24px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward{bottom:3px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timeline{margin-top:25px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));row-gap:23px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track:before{display:none}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step{padding:0 5px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step-title{font-size:14px}}
@media(min-width:750px) and (max-width:990px){.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{column-gap:24px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual{min-height:260px}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--box{height:min({{ block.settings.return_image_height }}px,220px)}.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--baby{height:min({{ block.settings.baby_image_height }}px,175px)}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<section class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner"><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro"><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__copy"><p class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2 class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title"><span>Outgrown,</span><span>Not Outworn.</span></h2><p class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings.description | escape | replace: block.settings.discount_text, '<strong>' }}</p><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pills"><span class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 2.5C7 2.5 3 5.5 3 9.5c0 2 1.5 3.5 3.5 3.5 4 0 7-4 7-10.5ZM2 14c2-3 4.5-5 8-7"/></svg>{{ block.settings.pill_one | escape }}</span><span class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="6" cy="5" r="2.3"/><path d="M1.8 13c.2-2.3 1.7-3.6 4.2-3.6s4 1.3 4.2 3.6M11 3.5a2 2 0 0 1 0 3.8m.8 2.2c1.4.4 2.2 1.5 2.4 3.2"/></svg>{{ block.settings.pill_two | escape }}</span><span class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 13.7 2.2 8.3A3.4 3.4 0 0 1 7 3.5L8 4.6l1-1.1a3.4 3.4 0 0 1 4.8 4.8L8 13.7Z"/></svg>{{ block.settings.pill_three | escape }}</span></div><a class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cta" href="{{ block.settings.button_link | default: '#' }}">{{ block.settings.button_label | escape }}</a></div><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__visual"><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--box">{% if block.settings.return_image != blank %}<img src="{{ block.settings.return_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.return_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div><span class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add return package photo</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__photo--baby">{% if block.settings.baby_image != blank %}<img src="{{ block.settings.baby_image | image_url: width: 600 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.baby_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div><span class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__empty">Add baby lifestyle photo</span>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward"><span class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__percent">{{ block.settings.discount_text | escape }}</span><span class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__reward-caption">{{ block.settings.reward_caption | escape }}</span></div></div></div><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timeline"><p class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__timeline-label">{{ block.settings.timeline_label | escape }}</p><div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track">{% for i in (1..4) %}{% liquid
assign title_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_title'
assign desc_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_description'
assign icon_key = 'step_' | append: i | append: '_icon'
assign step_title = block.settings[title_key]
assign step_desc = block.settings[desc_key]
assign step_icon = block.settings[icon_key]
%}<div class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step{% if i == 2 %} ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step--featured{% endif %}"><span class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true">{% case step_icon %}{% when 'package' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m3 7 9-4 9 4-9 5-9-5Z"/><path d="M3 7v10l9 4 9-4V7M12 12v9M7.5 4.5l9 5"/></svg>{% when 'percent' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 5 5 19"/><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="2.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2.5"/></svg>{% when 'house' %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m3 10 9-7 9 7M5 9v12h14V9M9 21v-7h6v7"/></svg>{% else %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2M9 9h.01M15 9h.01"/></svg>{% endcase %}</span><h3 class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step-title">{{ step_title | escape }}</h3><p class="ai-return-{{ ai_gen_id }}__step-desc">{{ step_desc | escape }}</p></div>{% endfor %}</div></div></div></section>
